{"3962110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Soul Stone Defense", "steam_appid": 3962110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend the Soul Stone at all costs.</strong><br>You play as a restless ghost bound to a mystical Soul Stone. When the monsters come, it’s your job to protect it — by building defenses, summoning allies, and even possessing your warriors to fight on the front lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you’ll expand and prepare your base. By night, endless waves of monsters attack — and survival depends on both your strategy and your combat skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Base Building</strong> – Place spawners, turrets, mines, and walls to create the ultimate defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possession Combat</strong> – Take control of your NPC allies at any time. Dodge, slash, and fight directly to turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradable Defenses</strong> – Strengthen spawners to summon tougher allies, reinforce your walls, and unlock new tools as days pass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Day/Night Cycle</strong> – Gather resources and build during the day. Face intense, large-scale monster assaults at night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Challenge</strong> – Each midnight brings stronger enemies, bigger waves, and higher rewards. How many days can you survive?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy World</strong> – Battle demons, monsters, and supernatural foes in a stylized, atmospheric setting.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💀 Survive the Endless Nights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to lose is to let your Soul Stone fall. Every decision matters — from where you build your defenses, to which ally you possess, to how you spend your limited resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you survive one night? Ten nights? Or none at all?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend the Soul Stone at all costs.</strong><br>You play as a restless ghost bound to a mystical Soul Stone. When the monsters come, it’s your job to protect it — by building defenses, summoning allies, and even possessing your warriors to fight on the front lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you’ll expand and prepare your base. By night, endless waves of monsters attack — and survival depends on both your strategy and your combat skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Base Building</strong> – Place spawners, turrets, mines, and walls to create the ultimate defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possession Combat</strong> – Take control of your NPC allies at any time. Dodge, slash, and fight directly to turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradable Defenses</strong> – Strengthen spawners to summon tougher allies, reinforce your walls, and unlock new tools as days pass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Day/Night Cycle</strong> – Gather resources and build during the day. Face intense, large-scale monster assaults at night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Challenge</strong> – Each midnight brings stronger enemies, bigger waves, and higher rewards. How many days can you survive?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy World</strong> – Battle demons, monsters, and supernatural foes in a stylized, atmospheric setting.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💀 Survive the Endless Nights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to lose is to let your Soul Stone fall. Every decision matters — from where you build your defenses, to which ally you possess, to how you spend your limited resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you survive one night? Ten nights? Or none at all?</strong></p>", "short_description": "A dark fantasy tower defense and survival game where you build defenses by day and possess your warriors by night to fight off endless waves of monsters.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962110/34f1b6bb095365fe797903a5883434a0e471763a/header.jpg?t=1776012301", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962110/ddffa8bee807c83e0cc14fec8445c08680522cbf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776012301", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962110/ddffa8bee807c83e0cc14fec8445c08680522cbf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776012301", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-6400 or AMD FX 8310<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1030 or AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["SoloDevTom"], "publishers": ["SoloDevTom"], "demos": [{"appid": 4930230, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": 